==Trivia==
*Somolon and all other stages from [[Darararah (Cats of the Cosmos)|Darararah]] through [[Ababwa (Cats of the Cosmos)|Ababwa]] have a robot (from the ''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]'' series) on top of their base, with the lower half being the Pegasus White Base.
*Somolon's name and Confetti [[Treasure]] are a reference to [[wikia:gundam:Solomon|Solomon]], an asteroid in ''Mobile Suit Gundam'' which was eventually renamed to Confeito. The stage also has a vaguely similar shape on the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] map.

